    url: "https://github.com/openai/math/tree/main/preprints/Exact-Fourier-certificates-for-complex-Hadamard-matrices-of-order-six-September-24-2026"
  - type: article
    title: "A gap for the maximum number of mutually unbiased bases"
    authors:
